2\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- The midstream scheduler plugin repository is onboarded to Konflux with a\n56\t  passing build configuration.\n57\t- A commit to the repository triggers a build pipeline run that completes\n58\t  green, measured by the pipeline run status.\n59\t- The pipeline produces the plugin's container image artifact.\n60\t\n61\t## HLR Traceability\n62\t\n63\t- HLR-1 (P0, enabling): the build pipeline is required to ship the\n64\t  scheduler-plugin-based gang admission this branch depends on.\n65\t\n66\t## Branch Context\n67\t\n68\t- Branch B of the gang-admission semantics investigation: applies when\n69\t  scheduler-plugin work beyond Kueue is required. If Kueue-native semantics are\n70\t  sufficient, this epic is removed. Serial after midstream repo onboarding (the\n71\t  pipeline needs the repo); runs in parallel with the plugin integration work —\n72\t  the integration is gated by a green build pipeline acceptance criterion, not\n73\t  by a dependency on this onboarding.\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97582f8c6f1245c2","agent_id":"a840909f53461e0a9","session_id":"b2cc3a11-1e81-4f82-9914-5f96aea9b357","uuid":"bc5097cf-f1c3-4924-a446-0e593ca210e6","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:30:25.729Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bd9277056d645320","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9005 decomposition"}
